  "modifications": [
    "Strict Tencent SILK framing and fail-closed decode; cooperative checkpoints and output bounds; explicit CDF bounds, range coder buffer/carry guards; NLSF and pulse codec array/overflow guards; production encoding uses the complete Greepar encoder rather than this simplified encoder",
    "DecoderEngine rejects >1024 arithmetic payload instead of implicit PLC and rejects a fifth frame declaring continuation or missing continuation bytes.",
    "Parameter pitch and inverse NSQ preflight validate every history, prediction, re-whitening, frame and output region before unsafe DSP."
